{"title":"Career Roadmap · Data Engineer","role":"Data Engineer","summary":"A Data Engineer designs, builds, maintains, and optimizes the systems that collect, transform, store, and deliver data for analytics, applications, and AI/ML systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"CSE – Artificial Intelligence & Data Science (AI&DS)"},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Historical data"}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Engineer designs, builds, maintains, and optimizes the systems that collect, transform, store, and deliver data for analytics, applications, and AI/ML systems."},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSE–AI&DS graduate, this is a particularly strong career pathway because the degree already provides foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"Artificial intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The key difference is that a Data Engineer focuses primarily on data infrastructure and pipelines, rather than building dashboards or ML models alone."},{"type":"p","text":"A realistic progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Engineering Intern","Junior Data Engineer","Data Engineer","Senior Data Engineer","Data Engineering Lead/Architect"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"2026–2030","text":"Data Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Relational databases"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"ETL/ELT"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential entry-level roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"