"text":"Schema changes"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Lineage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Vector & AI Data Infrastructure"},{"type":"p","text":"AI systems increasingly require pipelines for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Vector databases"},{"text":"Retrieval data"},{"text":"Document processing"},{"text":"Feature data"},{"text":"This creates an emerging intersection between Data Engineering and AI Engineering."}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","Data Structures","Linux"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Database"},{"type":"flow","items":["Advanced SQL","PostgreSQL","Data Modeling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Engineering"},{"type":"flow","items":["ETL/ELT","Pipelines","Data Quality"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Big Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["Spark","Kafka","Distributed Processing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"h","text":"One primary cloud platform"},{"type":"h","text":"Orchestration"},{"type":"flow","items":["Airflow","Scheduling","Monitoring"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Storage"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Warehouse","Data Lake/Lakehouse","Parquet"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"flow","items":["Git","Docker","CI/CD"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"flow","items":["ML Data Pipelines","Feature Engineering","AI Data Infrastructure"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Power BI","Statistics","Data Visualization"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile would be:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. CSE – Artificial Intelligence & Data Science graduate with strong expertise in Python, advanced SQL, database systems, data modeling, ETL/ELT, cloud data platforms and distributed data processing, supported by Spark, Airflow, data-quality engineering and AI/ML d